A Suggestion: It seems to me that every nasty item in nethack should have 
some sort of use. Nasty scrolls and potions for example can be rewritten or
converted to holy water. There are a number of items however which seem to
have a downside but no upside. It seems to me that finding a useful purpose 
for these nasty things would greatly improve the game.

The following examples are the kind of thing that I mean.

#1: Rings of hunger.
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
A cursed ring of hunger is self explanatory - you don't want to wear one for
very long. What do you do with it once you have finally de-cursed the thing
however? Consider the following.

An uncursed ring of hunger should be just like a cursed ring of hunger, however
it should of course be removeable, and it should also be impossible to kill
yourself by overeating while wearing it.

A Blessed ring of hunger should protect against overeating just like an
uncursed ring, but should not use up food as you wear it.

#2: Loadstones
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
Very nasty. Once you have managed to get the curse off however - what use is
it? Loadstones in fact have a nasty tendency to spontaneously become re-cursed 
once dropped. Consider the following.

An uncursed loadstone - should weigh as much as a normal stone so you can carry
it around. Perhaps it should also do a rather hefty amount of damage if used 
in a sling.

A Blessed loadstone - should have a large negative weight when picked up. This
will enable you to carry a lot of stuff you otherwise could not.

#3: Amulets of strangulation
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
OK - so you finally get it off before buying the farm. Now what on earth can
you do with an uncursed amulet of strangulation. How about -

An uncursed amulet of strangulation - Not much different from an amulet of
strangulation, but at least you can take it off. Hang onto it though, because
if you get a potion of holy water you can make a ...

A Blessed amulet of strangulation - This amulet no longer strangles you.
Instead it prevents you from strangling or dying through lack of air. If
you wear this amulet you can just walk through pools of water without
drowning.

#4: A cursed -5 ring of adornment
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
At last you remove the curse (and the ring) - your appearance no longer
frightens small children. What can you do with an uncursed -5 ring of
adornment though - not much. Even if you bless it it remains a `Blessed -5
ring of adornment' and still makes you look like a nuclear disaster zone.
How about the following.

An uncursed -5 ring of adornment is not much use, however if you can obtain 
some holy water you can bless it, in which case it becomes a blessed +5 ring
of adornment! Get it? If the ring is blessed, the charm should act in a
positive fashion. Similarly a +5 ring of adornment which gets cursed should
become a -5 ring of adornment.

#5: A cursed -2 ring of strength
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
Same idea as for rings of adornment - bless them and they become positive.


I could go on, however I would like to give others a chance to try their
hands at this game. Can you find something useful to do with uncursed boots
of fumbling for example? What about rings of aggravate monster? I look 
forward to reading other suggestions along these lines.

